                <pb facs="0657" n="635" sameAs="frus:frus1950v05/pg635"/>

                <head>Agreements between the United States and Iran</head>
                <p>[For text of agreement revising and extending the agreement of October 6, 1947,
                    effected by exchange of notes dated at Tehran November 28, 1949, and January 10,
                    1950, entered into force January 10, 1950, operative from March 20, 1950, see
                    United States Treaties and Other International Agreements (UST), <ref target="frus:frus1950v01/pg_415">volume
                        1, page 415</ref>.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND IRAN CONCERNING
                    MUTUAL DEFENSE ASSISTANCE</p>
                <p>[For text of agreement effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington May 23,
                    1950, entered into force on that date, see 1 UST
                    420.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND
                    IRAN FOR TECHNICAL COOPERATION ON RURAL IMPROVEMENT</p>
                <p>[For text of memorandum signed at Tehran October 19, 1950, entered into force on
                    that date, see 1 UST 727.]</p>
            </div>
